          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "data": "training rows 349590 dates 2013-02-15 to 2015-12-23 rise proportion 0.5454\nvalidation rows 122801 dates 2016-01-04 to 2016-12-22 rise proportion 0.5476\ntesting rows 126001 dates 2017-01-03 to 2017-12-29 rise proportion 0.5634\nInput validation passed.\n"
