        "code": "SUCCESS",
        "msg": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "data": "Added 21 historical features. V2 has 26 total available features.\nMissing training values (filled from TRAINING medians only):\n-RECORD 0----------------------\n volatility_5d         | 0     \n volatility_60d        | 0     \n vol_ratio_5_60        | 0     \n abs_return_5d         | 0     \n range_5d              | 0     \n return_20d            | 7425  \n volume_z_20d          | 0     \n market_return_1d      | 0     \n market_volatility_5d  | 0     \n return_10d            | 2475  \n return_60d            | 27166 \n price_to_ma20         | 0     \n price_to_ma60         | 0     \n price_in_range_20d    | 0     \n return_vs_vol20       | 7425  \n relative_return_5d    | 0     \n relative_return_20d   | 7425  \n market_avg_return_5d  | 0     \n market_avg_return_20d | 0     \n market_breadth_1d     | 0     \n market_breadth_5d     | 0     \n\n"
          }
        ]
